Written by the fail2zig contributors.
.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at
.UR https://github.com/ul0gic/fail2zig/issues
.UE .
.PP
Known limitations:
.IP \(bu 2
The
.B reload
command is a stub; restart the daemon to apply config changes.
.IP \(bu 2
A manual
.B ban
without
.B \-\-duration
uses the
.B [defaults]
bantime, not the target jail's own bantime.
.
.SH HISTORY
fail2zig-client 0.1.0 was the first public release, April 2026.
fail2zig-client 0.3.0 was released September 2026.
